// Modifications: a `force(F: FnOnce()->i64)` applied to a plain fn `seven`, then
// a closure `|| { force(seven) }` that itself calls `force(seven)`. Tests a
// closure closing over a fn item and forwarding it to a generic FnOnce fn.
// (The Rust source's block-wrapped `{ || force(f) }` form trims to the bare
